⍝ ExpandAxis.tc
⍝ ═════════════

⍝@ test4.

      ⎕IO←1

      ⍝ Precond: LO simple Boolean with exactly (⍴B)[1] 1s (dyadic \
      ⍝ requires the number of 1s in LO to equal the length of B along
      ⍝ the expanded axis); X∊⍳⍴⍴B
      ⍝ inv: (⍴Z)[,X] ←→ ⍴,LO   (expanded axis length = ⍴LO)
      ⍝ inv: ⍴⍴Z ←→ ⍴⍴B
      B ← ⎕RVAL 2 (3 4) (,0 1 0 0 0)
      NTRUE ← (⍴B)[1]                        ⍝ LO needs exactly this many 1s
      NPAD ← 3∣|⎕RVAL 0                      ⍝ 0..2 extra 0s, for some length variety
      LO ← (NTRUE⍴1),NPAD⍴0
      LO ← ((≢LO)∣|⎕RVAL 0)⌽LO               ⍝ random rotation for position variety
      Z ← LO\[1]B
      (1↑⍴Z) ≡ ⍴,LO
1
      (⍴⍴Z) ≡ ⍴⍴B
1
